WEBVTT

00:00:55.540 --> 00:01:04.975
HP:(Hadal Shiinees ah)

00:01:04.975 --> 00:01:07.487
YR: Mushkilada kaliya aan ugu qarinayo

00:01:07.487 --> 00:01:09.037
luqada Shiinaha waa

00:01:09.037 --> 00:01:11.755
waxaan kaliya ku hadli karaa halkaan sadar,

00:01:11.755 --> 00:01:13.534
oo aan si niyad ah ubartay

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:16.204
mar aan booqday Shiinaha. (Qosol)

00:01:16.204 --> 00:01:20.092
Marka isla sadarkii ayaan dhoor cod ku celcelinayaa

00:01:20.092 --> 00:01:21.952
waxan rajeynaya inaadan dareemin.

00:01:21.952 --> 00:01:27.301
(Qosol)

00:01:27.301 --> 00:01:31.481
HP:(Hadal Shiinees ah)